So I wanna make sure that I'm doing things

00:44:09.120 --> 00:44:10.240
not necessarily right,

00:44:10.240 --> 00:44:12.650
but I wanna be the best
at whatever it is, right.

00:44:12.650 --> 00:44:13.523
I wanna perform.

00:44:14.390 --> 00:44:15.970
And those are actually pretty similar,

00:44:15.970 --> 00:44:18.040
they manifest themselves
in pretty similar ways,

00:44:18.040 --> 00:44:23.010
