00:44:23.010 --> 00:44:26.480
And so me and you tend
to be super self aware,

00:44:26.480 --> 00:44:28.660
and we analyze everything.

00:44:28.660 --> 00:44:32.090
And we're thinking about
things almost like a filmmaker,

00:44:32.090 --> 00:44:33.120
you know, stepping back

00:44:33.120 --> 00:44:36.000
