01:00:17.050 --> 01:00:18.780
because I realized in a number of ways

01:00:18.780 --> 01:00:19.790
that I'm looking at it wrong

01:00:19.790 --> 01:00:22.430
and I, you know, I do realize going back

01:00:22.430 --> 01:00:27.390
