01:00:59.490 --> 01:01:03.810
that you wanna improve in your life,

01:01:03.810 --> 01:01:05.470
it could be spiritual in nature,

01:01:05.470 --> 01:01:07.210
it could be practical in nature.

01:01:07.210 --> 01:01:09.680
But then you've got someone
who will hold you accountable

01:01:09.680 --> 01:01:11.053
when you get together.

01:01:13.569 --> 01:01:17.700
The main point of the meeting
is for them to ask you,

01:01:18.740 --> 01:01:20.440
'cause you've given them permission.

01:01:20.440 --> 01:01:22.290
It's kind of like a personal trainer.

01:01:23.300 --> 01:01:24.300
Especially in these times

01:01:24.300 --> 01:01:25.758
where you're not with
the personal trainer,

01:01:25.758 --> 01:01:27.710
and you're like have you done
your exercises this week?

01:01:27.710 --> 01:01:29.000
Well, it could be that for anything

01:01:29.000 --> 01:01:29.860
