01:02:00.800 --> 01:02:05.800
the ultimate accountability
hack is just lying

01:02:06.430 --> 01:02:07.540
I never lie.

01:02:07.540 --> 01:02:08.430
You lie to cover

01:02:08.430 --> 01:02:09.590
accountability porn?.
No, no, no, no,

01:02:09.590 --> 01:02:12.390
I'm saying that, no I didn't lie.

01:02:12.390 --> 01:02:16.980
But I figured out later
that some of the people,

01:02:16.980 --> 01:02:17.813
They were hacking

01:02:17.813 --> 01:02:19.230
the system.
They were hacking

01:02:19.230 --> 01:02:20.850
the system, they were lying.

01:02:20.850 --> 01:02:22.260
They were hacking more than the system,

01:02:22.260 --> 01:02:24.394
they were hacking the lumber.

01:02:28.510 --> 01:02:30.240
I've never actually heard
that as a euphemism,

01:02:30.240 --> 01:02:32.550
but I think I--
Well I think it's whack

01:02:32.550 --> 01:02:34.590
the lumber.
Okay, well--

01:02:34.590 --> 01:02:36.480
To be specific.

01:02:36.480 --> 01:02:40.060
I feel like and then when
you go to counseling,

01:02:40.060 --> 01:02:44.100
if you have a problem, and you like

01:02:44.100 --> 01:02:46.100
when I would meet with my pastor,

01:02:46.100 --> 01:02:48.477
it'll be like, "I'm dealing with this."

01:02:49.770 --> 01:02:51.910
It was a positive experience.

01:02:51.910 --> 01:02:53.410
But I think in my mind,

01:02:53.410 --> 01:02:55.440
there was a negative aspect to it,

01:02:55.440 --> 01:02:58.370
that I now apply to therapy

01:02:58.370 --> 01:03:03.370
and that is, I always
assumed there was a judgment.

01:03:04.880 --> 01:03:05.760
You know, it's like--
It's like

01:03:05.760 --> 01:03:06.930
going to confession.

01:03:06.930 --> 01:03:08.500
It's like going to confession
if you're Catholic,

01:03:08.500 --> 01:03:10.477
which we never were,
but yeah, so it's like,

01:03:10.477 --> 01:03:11.718
"Hey, I'm sharing this."

01:03:11.718 --> 01:03:13.410
And then the response

